SEC-HTTPS-001.remediation:
Configure your web server to redirect all HTTP traffic to HTTPS with a 301 or 308 redirect.

For Apache (.htaccess):
RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://%{HTTP_HOST}/$1 [R=301,L]

For Nginx:
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name example.com;
    return 301 https://$server_name$request_uri;
}

